===== Program to read ccp4/MRC map volumes and correct the files

Source:
 * directory mdsmaps : contains classes for the four executables
 * directory mdsmaps/mapread : contains main classes to read/write maps and headers

Executables:
 * MapTest: will read the header and data and return various stuff - readonly
 * MapTestBig : is a version with limited functionality to manage huge maps
 * MapFix:  will create a new map with data in
 * MapFixBig:  will create a new map with data in for huge maps and limited functionality

===== Compiling java and building the jar files

Use "./MakeAll" in the main directory

===== Running the program

java -jar mapFix.jar .....   (-help will list all the run tim parameters)
java -jar mapTest.jar .....  (no parameters will tell you what to do !)


Example test to fix all the normal problems : creates "crap.map"
java -jar mapFix.jar -in testmap/normal.map out testmap/crap.map -all

Example to read a map  : no changes
jara -jar mapTest.jar testmap/normal.map

=====  Modifying the code

Edit the version file to define the changes before checking
msdmap/Version.java : code to define the version date

